1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,467
Did you know

2
00:00:00,467 --> 00:00:01,400
a fish carved

3
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,333
this circle?

4
00:00:02,333 --> 00:00:03,567
Off southern Japan,

5
00:00:03,567 --> 00:00:04,333
a male pufferfish

6
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:05,567
about 4 inches long

7
00:00:05,567 --> 00:00:06,467
builds a nest

8
00:00:06,467 --> 00:00:07,967
over 6 feet wide.

9
00:00:07,967 --> 00:00:09,100
Watch his fins.

10
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:09,800
He swims toward

11
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:10,600
the center,

12
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:11,267
kicking sand

13
00:00:11,267 --> 00:00:12,433
to either side.

14
00:00:12,433 --> 00:00:13,133
One pass cuts

15
00:00:13,133 --> 00:00:14,067
a groove.

16
00:00:14,067 --> 00:00:14,900
Hundreds of passes

17
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:15,633
leave a ring

18
00:00:15,633 --> 00:00:16,567
of ridges.

19
00:00:16,567 --> 00:00:17,067
If a female

20
00:00:17,067 --> 00:00:18,467
chooses this nest,

21
00:00:18,467 --> 00:00:19,300
she lays her eggs

22
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,167
in the middle.

23
00:00:20,167 --> 00:00:20,667
Can you spot

24
00:00:20,667 --> 00:00:21,667
him now?
